# Locator Priority

Prefer locators in this order:

1. `page.getByTestId('...')` — matches data-testid (NOT html id)
2. `page.getByRole('button', { name: '...' })` — when element has accessible name
3. `page.getByLabel('...')` / `page.getByPlaceholder('...')`
4. `page.locator('#id')` or CSS — last resort

Notes:
- getByTestId('username') finds data-testid="username", not id="username"
- App uses data-testid attributes (e.g. username-input, password-input, login-error)